# Starch's level code: entered only through the slot at &8E18C, which the
# game fills with the current level's 256-byte header (copied from
# &8100 + level * &100). Each header starts with branches - at +0, +8, +&C
# and +&10 - to its level's routines; these are their targets as the slot
# places them. SuperSpider sees the copy (a slot: source unknown) but not
# what goes into it.
# level 1
8e3b8
91dc0
91ca4
8e3d8
# level 2
91e88
94e04
94cc0
91eb8
# level 3
94f4c
97ed8
97d48
94f88
# level 4
97f3c
9aca0
9ab28
97f74
# level 5
9ad40
9e0a4
9df14
9ad84
